1
00:00:18,852 --> 00:00:20,895
<font color="white">This is such a precious thing.</font><font color="white"></font>

2
00:00:20,979 --> 00:00:23,398
<font color="white">-Are you really giving it to me?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

3
00:00:25,817 --> 00:00:27,026
<font color="white">Let him be.</font><font color="white"></font>

4
00:00:27,110 --> 00:00:28,820
<font color="white">He is simply delighted.</font><font color="white"></font>

5
00:00:32,782 --> 00:00:33,616
<font color="white"><i>Cousin Yun.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

6
00:00:34,409 --> 00:00:37,495
<font color="white"><i>Have you ever seen the map</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>drawn by the Italian, Matteo Ricci?</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

7
00:00:38,621 --> 00:00:42,250
<font color="white"><i>It took me quite some time</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to find Joseon upon it.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

8
00:00:43,334 --> 00:00:45,712
<font color="white"><i>Joseon, which had always seemed</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>so vast and unmistakable,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

9
00:00:45,795 --> 00:00:47,422
<font color="white"><i>suddenly felt so small.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

10
00:00:48,423 --> 00:00:50,383
<font color="white"><i>It filled me with a sudden fear.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

11
00:00:51,551 --> 00:00:54,304
<font color="white"><i>How small must I be,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

12
00:00:54,387 --> 00:00:56,389
<font color="white"><i>living in one corner of Hwaseong?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

13
00:01:13,156 --> 00:01:14,240
<font color="white">A letter!</font><font color="white"></font>

14
00:01:15,283 --> 00:01:16,284
<font color="white">Over here!</font><font color="white"></font>

15
00:01:16,367 --> 00:01:18,578
<font color="white">It is for the young lady</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of Vice Minister Cho's house!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

16
00:01:18,661 --> 00:01:19,496
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

17
00:01:20,121 --> 00:01:21,748
<font color="white"><i>I unfolded the map</i></font><font color="white"></font>

18
00:01:21,831 --> 00:01:24,250
<font color="white"><i>drawn in Joseon centuries ago.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

19
00:01:25,418 --> 00:01:27,337
<font color="white"><i>By the standards of Western learning,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

20
00:01:27,879 --> 00:01:30,590
<font color="white"><i>the size of Joseon upon it</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>is plainly wrong.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

21
00:01:31,925 --> 00:01:35,261
<font color="white"><i>And yet, I found myself wondering,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

22
00:01:35,345 --> 00:01:36,888
<font color="white"><i>"Is it truly wrong?"</i></font><font color="white"></font>

23
00:01:37,764 --> 00:01:39,974
<font color="white"><i>Perhaps they merely wished to capture</i></font><font color="white"></font>

24
00:01:40,058 --> 00:01:42,393
<font color="white"><i>the hearts of those</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>who stood upon this small land.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

25
00:01:43,812 --> 00:01:46,606
<font color="white"><i>And so, through the two different Joseons</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>drawn upon these maps,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

26
00:01:46,689 --> 00:01:47,982
<font color="white"><i>I came to realize something.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

27
00:01:49,108 --> 00:01:51,236
<font color="white"><i>Whether it be large or small,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

28
00:01:51,903 --> 00:01:53,738
<font color="white"><i>we see the world through our own eyes,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

29
00:01:53,822 --> 00:01:56,825
<font color="white"><i>and they through theirs.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

30
00:01:58,785 --> 00:02:02,831
<font color="white"><i>Just as I am simply me,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>and you are simply you.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

31
00:02:05,542 --> 00:02:06,417
<font color="white"><i>What do you think?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

32
00:02:07,502 --> 00:02:09,129
<font color="white"><i>You may call it sophistry,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

33
00:02:09,838 --> 00:02:13,758
<font color="white"><i>yet I am most curious to hear what you,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>my literary friend, make of it.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

34
00:02:14,884 --> 00:02:16,219
<font color="white"><i>I shall await your reply.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

35
00:02:23,184 --> 00:02:25,937
<font color="white">Keep your blade firm. Straight and strong.</font><font color="white"></font>

36
00:02:26,604 --> 00:02:28,690
<font color="white">Uphold the way of a gentleman.</font><font color="white"></font>

37
00:02:28,773 --> 00:02:29,774
<font color="white">Do you understand?</font><font color="white"></font>

38
00:02:48,960 --> 00:02:49,794
<font color="white">Straight</font><font color="white"></font>

39
00:02:51,421 --> 00:02:52,297
<font color="white">and strong.</font><font color="white"></font>

40
00:02:53,131 --> 00:02:54,090
<font color="white">Straight</font><font color="white"></font>

41
00:02:54,883 --> 00:02:55,800
<font color="white">and strong.</font><font color="white"></font>

42
00:02:56,467 --> 00:02:57,302
<font color="white">Strong.</font><font color="white"></font>

43
00:02:59,679 --> 00:03:01,598
<font color="white"><i>I lost my father so suddenly,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

44
00:03:02,432 --> 00:03:04,976
<font color="white"><i>and there is no stopping</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>this grief that rises within me.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

45
00:03:06,895 --> 00:03:08,521
<font color="white"><i>I need my father.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

46
00:03:10,106 --> 00:03:13,359
<font color="white"><i>I wished to become</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>the sort of son he would be proud of,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

47
00:03:14,402 --> 00:03:15,570
<font color="white"><i>but now it is too late.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

48
00:03:16,571 --> 00:03:17,405
<font color="white"><i>Cousin Yun.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

49
00:03:18,364 --> 00:03:19,908
<font color="white"><i>What am I to do?</i></font><font color="white"></font>

50
00:03:21,659 --> 00:03:24,954
<font color="white"><i>I am only sorry</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>that I cannot fully fathom your pain.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

51
00:03:26,039 --> 00:03:27,040
<font color="white"><i>But Won,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

52
00:03:27,540 --> 00:03:31,669
<font color="white"><i>the person Uncle wished you to become</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>is not the only true answer.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

53
00:03:32,545 --> 00:03:34,380
<font color="white"><i>I felt I had to tell you that myself.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

54
00:03:35,840 --> 00:03:37,967
<font color="white"><i>Rather than chasing after</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>another's footsteps,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

55
00:03:38,051 --> 00:03:39,802
<font color="white"><i>you must find yourself.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

56
00:03:40,887 --> 00:03:44,057
<font color="white"><i>Though my words</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>may not reach your heart just yet.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

57
00:03:46,267 --> 00:03:47,685
<font color="white"><i>"I am me,</i></font><font color="white"></font>

58
00:03:49,103 --> 00:03:50,146
<font color="white"><i>and you are you."</i></font><font color="white"></font>

59
00:03:57,820 --> 00:04:02,325
<font color="white">THE SCANDAL</font><font color="white"></font>

60
00:04:09,999 --> 00:04:11,834
<font color="white">How indecent.</font><font color="white"></font>

61
00:04:17,924 --> 00:04:18,800
<font color="white">Madam.</font><font color="white"></font>

62
00:04:19,342 --> 00:04:23,429
<font color="white">Lady Cho, the wife of Minister Yoo,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is here to see you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

63
00:04:26,057 --> 00:04:27,475
<font color="white">Send her in.</font><font color="white"></font>

64
00:04:31,104 --> 00:04:33,106
<font color="white">Though it bears no dye,</font><font color="white"></font>

65
00:04:33,731 --> 00:04:35,483
<font color="white">it shines so splendidly.</font><font color="white"></font>

66
00:04:36,276 --> 00:04:39,946
<font color="white">I must say, this silk resembles you.</font><font color="white"></font>

67
00:04:40,989 --> 00:04:43,658
<font color="white">The tobacco you sent last night</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">was more than enough,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

68
00:04:44,450 --> 00:04:46,160
<font color="white">yet you bring this as well.</font><font color="white"></font>

69
00:04:47,203 --> 00:04:48,746
<font color="white">Thank you.</font><font color="white"></font>

70
00:04:51,499 --> 00:04:53,668
<font color="white">I shall treasure it.</font><font color="white"></font>

71
00:04:54,294 --> 00:04:56,045
<font color="white">You are too gracious.</font><font color="white"></font>

72
00:04:57,005 --> 00:04:59,048
<font color="white">I am deeply humbled by your words.</font><font color="white"></font>

73
00:04:59,674 --> 00:05:03,469
<font color="white">Though truthfully,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I could not sleep all night for fear</font><font color="white"></font></font>

74
00:05:03,553 --> 00:05:06,597
<font color="white">you may have been displeased</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">by my cousin's misconduct.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

75
00:05:06,681 --> 00:05:07,682
<font color="white">Just as I thought.</font><font color="white"></font>

76
00:05:09,058 --> 00:05:12,729
<font color="white">Even between cousins,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">it could not have been an easy decision.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

77
00:05:14,105 --> 00:05:16,733
<font color="white">Since you are a lady</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who knows propriety and decorum,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

78
00:05:16,816 --> 00:05:18,985
<font color="white">you chose the late hour to inform me,</font><font color="white"></font>

79
00:05:19,610 --> 00:05:21,446
<font color="white">the Left State Councilor,</font><font color="white"></font>

80
00:05:22,196 --> 00:05:24,657
<font color="white">and our In-ho quietly of the matter.</font><font color="white"></font>

81
00:05:25,325 --> 00:05:26,367
<font color="white">Especially</font><font color="white"></font>

82
00:05:27,285 --> 00:05:29,787
<font color="white">with a widowed daughter-in-law</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in this household.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

83
00:05:31,664 --> 00:05:33,041
<font color="white">Thank you, Lady Cho.</font><font color="white"></font>

84
00:05:34,000 --> 00:05:34,876
<font color="white">Thanks to you,</font><font color="white"></font>

85
00:05:35,960 --> 00:05:40,048
<font color="white">I summoned In-ho</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">at the crack of dawn and firmly warned him</font><font color="white"></font></font>

86
00:05:41,215 --> 00:05:43,051
<font color="white">not to trouble your cousin further.</font><font color="white"></font>

87
00:05:44,218 --> 00:05:47,138
<font color="white">One's studies ought to be pursued</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">by one's own efforts.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

88
00:05:47,221 --> 00:05:48,931
<font color="white">Hearing you say so</font><font color="white"></font>

89
00:05:49,640 --> 00:05:51,976
<font color="white">finally puts my mind at ease, however…</font><font color="white"></font>

90
00:05:56,105 --> 00:05:57,148
<font color="white">What's the matter?</font><font color="white"></font>

91
00:06:02,737 --> 00:06:07,158
<font color="white">I wish to believe your daughter-in-law</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">shall handle the matter wisely,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

92
00:06:07,241 --> 00:06:10,286
<font color="white">but I must regretfully say my cousin</font><font color="white"></font>

93
00:06:11,370 --> 00:06:13,581
<font color="white">is no ordinary man.</font><font color="white"></font>

94
00:06:14,165 --> 00:06:15,500
<font color="white">I know.</font><font color="white"></font>

95
00:06:15,583 --> 00:06:17,376
<font color="white">I know that very well indeed.</font><font color="white"></font>

96
00:06:19,003 --> 00:06:23,466
<font color="white">With a face so excessively handsome,</font><font color="white"></font>

97
00:06:23,549 --> 00:06:25,885
<font color="white">how could anyone fail to suspect as much?</font><font color="white"></font>

98
00:06:28,930 --> 00:06:30,681
<font color="white">Which is why I say this.</font><font color="white"></font>

99
00:06:32,517 --> 00:06:35,978
<font color="white">In the end,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">they are but a young man and woman.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

100
00:06:37,522 --> 00:06:41,567
<font color="white">Even two shadows lose their boundaries</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">beneath the lamplight.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

101
00:06:43,194 --> 00:06:44,654
<font color="white">Would it not be safer</font><font color="white"></font>

102
00:06:45,279 --> 00:06:48,116
<font color="white">to keep them apart,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">even by force if necessary,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

103
00:06:48,199 --> 00:06:50,076
<font color="white">so they never cross paths?</font><font color="white"></font>

104
00:06:56,749 --> 00:06:58,918
<font color="white">Forgive me. That was presumptuous of me.</font><font color="white"></font>

105
00:07:16,769 --> 00:07:17,728
<font color="white">Come now!</font><font color="white"></font>

106
00:07:21,691 --> 00:07:23,609
<font color="white">There is no need for that.</font><font color="white"></font>

107
00:07:26,988 --> 00:07:29,615
<font color="white">You embarrass me by doing so.</font><font color="white"></font>

108
00:07:30,616 --> 00:07:31,492
<font color="white">Goodness.</font><font color="white"></font>

109
00:07:32,118 --> 00:07:35,746
<font color="white">If my husband learned of this,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I should never hear the end of it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

110
00:07:35,830 --> 00:07:37,999
<font color="white">Raise your head.</font><font color="white"></font>

111
00:07:38,082 --> 00:07:39,375
<font color="white">Come now.</font><font color="white"></font>

112
00:07:44,797 --> 00:07:46,716
<font color="white">Right, that reminds me.</font><font color="white"></font>

113
00:07:47,550 --> 00:07:49,802
<font color="white">How fares Minister Yoo these days?</font><font color="white"></font>

114
00:07:50,386 --> 00:07:53,264
<font color="white">He merely awaits a summons</font><font color="white"></font>

115
00:07:54,015 --> 00:07:55,600
<font color="white">from the Left State Councilor.</font><font color="white"></font>

116
00:08:14,243 --> 00:08:15,953
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

117
00:08:19,165 --> 00:08:19,999
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

118
00:08:22,251 --> 00:08:23,127
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

119
00:08:25,630 --> 00:08:28,216
<font color="white">The Left State Councilor has invited me</font><font color="white"></font>

120
00:08:29,217 --> 00:08:30,760
<font color="white">to the gathering of the ministers.</font><font color="white"></font>

121
00:08:32,136 --> 00:08:33,804
<font color="white">Do you know how long it has been?</font><font color="white"></font>

122
00:08:35,848 --> 00:08:36,807
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

123
00:08:37,308 --> 00:08:41,395
<font color="white">It would seem the Left State Councilor</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">has not forgotten your capabilities.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

124
00:08:42,605 --> 00:08:44,315
<font color="white">It is all thanks to you.</font><font color="white"></font>

125
00:08:45,733 --> 00:08:47,360
<font color="white">You have paid your respects</font><font color="white"></font>

126
00:08:47,443 --> 00:08:49,529
<font color="white">to the Lady of the First Rank</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">almost every day.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

127
00:08:49,612 --> 00:08:50,988
<font color="white">I am well aware of it.</font><font color="white"></font>

128
00:08:51,072 --> 00:08:53,866
<font color="white">How could that possibly be my doing?</font><font color="white"></font>

129
00:08:55,159 --> 00:08:56,077
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

130
00:09:07,380 --> 00:09:08,297
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

131
00:09:10,258 --> 00:09:11,133
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

132
00:09:12,885 --> 00:09:13,719
<font color="white">In truth,</font><font color="white"></font>

133
00:09:15,346 --> 00:09:17,139
<font color="white">I know as well.</font><font color="white"></font>

134
00:09:18,391 --> 00:09:20,685
<font color="white">That the lack of an heir in this house</font><font color="white"></font>

135
00:09:21,769 --> 00:09:23,688
<font color="white">is entirely because of me.</font><font color="white"></font>

136
00:09:24,855 --> 00:09:26,649
<font color="white">Though I knew it to be futile,</font><font color="white"></font>

137
00:09:27,650 --> 00:09:29,110
<font color="white">I still brought in a concubine.</font><font color="white"></font>

138
00:09:31,571 --> 00:09:35,116
<font color="white">Yet I fear I may fail</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to fulfill your wish nonetheless.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

139
00:09:35,658 --> 00:09:39,453
<font color="white">All the while, you have done nothing</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but strive for my sake.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

140
00:09:43,207 --> 00:09:45,793
<font color="white">My lord, you must not say such things.</font><font color="white"></font>

141
00:09:47,420 --> 00:09:49,839
<font color="white">So-ok shall prove it.</font><font color="white"></font>

142
00:09:51,007 --> 00:09:55,428
<font color="white">You shall most certainly have an heir.</font><font color="white"></font>

143
00:09:58,556 --> 00:09:59,390
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

144
00:10:09,275 --> 00:10:12,278
<font color="white">Yes. If you say so, then so it shall be.</font><font color="white"></font>

145
00:10:13,279 --> 00:10:15,239
<font color="white">I shall prove yet</font><font color="white"></font>

146
00:10:15,865 --> 00:10:17,867
<font color="white">that I am still a vigorous man!</font><font color="white"></font>

147
00:10:18,618 --> 00:10:22,246
<font color="white">-You will hurt yourself! Put me down!</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-I am not so frail yet!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

148
00:10:29,795 --> 00:10:31,505
<font color="white">-My lady.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Please put me down now.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

149
00:11:05,790 --> 00:11:06,707
<font color="white">Mind your step.</font><font color="white"></font>

150
00:11:15,549 --> 00:11:16,759
<font color="white">Forgive me.</font><font color="white"></font>

151
00:11:17,343 --> 00:11:18,344
<font color="white">No, wait…</font><font color="white"></font>

152
00:11:22,264 --> 00:11:23,182
<font color="white">You…</font><font color="white"></font>

153
00:11:23,891 --> 00:11:24,767
<font color="white">Yes?</font><font color="white"></font>

154
00:11:29,688 --> 00:11:31,190
<font color="white">Where are you going?</font><font color="white"></font>

155
00:11:32,817 --> 00:11:33,776
<font color="white">Nowhere.</font><font color="white"></font>

156
00:11:33,859 --> 00:11:35,611
<font color="white">I merely stepped out</font><font color="white"></font>

157
00:11:35,694 --> 00:11:37,988
<font color="white">because they said</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the moon was lovely tonight.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

158
00:11:44,412 --> 00:11:45,329
<font color="white">And who was it</font><font color="white"></font>

159
00:11:46,080 --> 00:11:50,084
<font color="white">you meant to meet</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">on such a lovely moonlit night?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

160
00:11:50,167 --> 00:11:51,836
<font color="white">-No, it is not that--</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Hush!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

161
00:11:54,130 --> 00:11:55,131
<font color="white">And still you persist?</font><font color="white"></font>

162
00:11:57,091 --> 00:11:59,927
<font color="white">Young Master In-ho.</font><font color="white"></font>

163
00:12:25,453 --> 00:12:28,122
<font color="white">This is a rough sketch</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">based on what I saw in a book.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

164
00:12:28,747 --> 00:12:29,874
<font color="white">It is an alarm clock.</font><font color="white"></font>

165
00:12:31,292 --> 00:12:33,961
<font color="white">A thing that lets one see the time.</font><font color="white"></font>

166
00:12:34,462 --> 00:12:37,131
<font color="white">This would be about</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a quarter of an hour past 9 p.m.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

167
00:12:37,673 --> 00:12:39,884
<font color="white">The single drumbeat earlier</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">signaled 7 p.m.,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

168
00:12:40,551 --> 00:12:42,011
<font color="white">so it should be about here.</font><font color="white"></font>

169
00:12:42,094 --> 00:12:42,970
<font color="white">Before long,</font><font color="white"></font>

170
00:12:44,096 --> 00:12:45,306
<font color="white">the 9 p.m. drum will sound.</font><font color="white"></font>

171
00:12:48,893 --> 00:12:51,937
<font color="white">I shall be listening from here as well,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">but I must not miss it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

172
00:12:52,521 --> 00:12:55,649
<font color="white">Go stand outside the gate,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and when you hear the drum strike twice,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

173
00:12:55,733 --> 00:12:57,109
<font color="white">come tell me at once.</font><font color="white"></font>

174
00:12:57,860 --> 00:12:58,694
<font color="white">Yes, sir.</font><font color="white"></font>

175
00:12:59,570 --> 00:13:00,988
<font color="white">Two drumbeats.</font><font color="white"></font>

176
00:13:01,572 --> 00:13:02,573
<font color="white">My lord!</font><font color="white"></font>

177
00:13:02,656 --> 00:13:04,492
<font color="white">So you meant to meet</font><font color="white"></font>

178
00:13:05,868 --> 00:13:08,621
<font color="white">when these hands</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">stretched straight across?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

179
00:13:09,246 --> 00:13:10,247
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

180
00:13:10,331 --> 00:13:13,125
<font color="white">I am so dumbfounded</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I scarcely know what to say.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

181
00:13:13,209 --> 00:13:15,044
<font color="white">Forgive me, my lord!</font><font color="white"></font>

182
00:13:15,127 --> 00:13:16,545
<font color="white">Let me explain.</font><font color="white"></font>

183
00:13:22,885 --> 00:13:24,345
<font color="white">It is only proper</font><font color="white"></font>

184
00:13:25,679 --> 00:13:29,558
<font color="white">that I tell my cousin</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and my brother-in-law of this matter.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

185
00:13:30,601 --> 00:13:32,186
<font color="white">Yet if I uphold propriety,</font><font color="white"></font>

186
00:13:32,853 --> 00:13:35,022
<font color="white">I betray my loyalty to Young Master In-ho.</font><font color="white"></font>

187
00:13:36,440 --> 00:13:39,860
<font color="white">And if I keep faith with him,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I stray from propriety.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

188
00:13:40,736 --> 00:13:42,613
<font color="white">Huh? Hold a moment.</font><font color="white"></font>

189
00:13:43,781 --> 00:13:45,157
<font color="white">Why did you come out so early?</font><font color="white"></font>

190
00:13:47,451 --> 00:13:48,285
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

191
00:13:54,583 --> 00:13:57,378
<font color="white">I happen to know how alarm clocks work.</font><font color="white"></font>

192
00:13:57,461 --> 00:13:58,712
<font color="white">For these hands</font><font color="white"></font>

193
00:13:58,796 --> 00:14:02,716
<font color="white">to stretch straight across like this,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">there is still quite some time left.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

194
00:14:06,554 --> 00:14:07,846
<font color="white">But I could swear earlier…</font><font color="white"></font>

195
00:14:08,973 --> 00:14:10,766
<font color="white">You do not even know how to read it?</font><font color="white"></font>

196
00:14:11,517 --> 00:14:13,477
<font color="white">No, I do know how.</font><font color="white"></font>

197
00:14:15,312 --> 00:14:16,647
<font color="white">You most certainly do not.</font><font color="white"></font>

198
00:14:18,357 --> 00:14:19,483
<font color="white">I tell you, I do…</font><font color="white"></font>

199
00:14:21,068 --> 00:14:23,237
<font color="white">But today,</font><font color="white"></font>

200
00:14:24,446 --> 00:14:27,491
<font color="white">my mind is troubled</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">by rather distressing matters.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

201
00:14:29,201 --> 00:14:30,578
<font color="white">So I shall pretend</font><font color="white"></font>

202
00:14:32,079 --> 00:14:33,414
<font color="white">I saw nothing of your affair.</font><font color="white"></font>

203
00:14:38,294 --> 00:14:39,545
<font color="white">Will you, really?</font><font color="white"></font>

204
00:14:39,628 --> 00:14:40,462
<font color="white">In return,</font><font color="white"></font>

205
00:14:41,130 --> 00:14:43,132
<font color="white">do not wander about and invite trouble.</font><font color="white"></font>

206
00:14:43,757 --> 00:14:45,009
<font color="white">Until the appointed hour,</font><font color="white"></font>

207
00:14:45,759 --> 00:14:49,263
<font color="white">stay shut away in your room</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and read </font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i>Elementary Learning</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white"> aloud.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

208
00:14:49,346 --> 00:14:52,099
<font color="white">I shall be outside listening for it.</font><font color="white"></font>

209
00:14:54,894 --> 00:14:56,520
<font color="white"><i>Elementary Learning</i></font><font color="white"><font color="white">?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

210
00:14:56,604 --> 00:14:58,022
<font color="white">Do you not know of it?</font><font color="white"></font>

211
00:14:58,606 --> 00:15:00,232
<font color="white">No, I know it.</font><font color="white"></font>

212
00:15:00,316 --> 00:15:01,859
<font color="white">I do, but…</font><font color="white"></font>

213
00:15:01,942 --> 00:15:02,860
<font color="white">But what?</font><font color="white"></font>

214
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,820
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

215
00:15:04,904 --> 00:15:06,405
<font color="white">I shall go to my cousin…</font><font color="white"></font>

216
00:15:06,906 --> 00:15:08,449
<font color="white">I am going.</font><font color="white"></font>

217
00:15:08,532 --> 00:15:09,700
<font color="white">I am going, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

218
00:15:16,040 --> 00:15:18,667
<font color="white">Young Master In-ho? Now hold a moment.</font><font color="white"></font>

219
00:15:19,501 --> 00:15:23,088
<font color="white">That means In-ho and So-ok…</font><font color="white"></font>

220
00:15:24,256 --> 00:15:25,716
<font color="white">Good grief.</font><font color="white"></font>

221
00:15:26,842 --> 00:15:27,927
<font color="white">What a complete mess.</font><font color="white"></font>

222
00:15:42,232 --> 00:15:44,318
<font color="white">Young Master, it is 9 p.m.</font><font color="white"></font>

223
00:16:14,348 --> 00:16:18,811
<font color="white">"Once a girl reaches the age of 10,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">she must not venture outside."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

224
00:16:18,894 --> 00:16:23,107
<font color="white">"She must meekly heed the teachings</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of her mother and teacher,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

225
00:16:23,190 --> 00:16:25,651
<font color="white">tend hemp and ramie…</font><font color="white"></font>

226
00:16:31,407 --> 00:16:33,909
<font color="white">raise silkworms, reel silk,</font><font color="white"></font>

227
00:16:33,993 --> 00:16:37,162
<font color="white">weave silk, and braid silk sashes…"</font><font color="white"></font>

228
00:16:50,009 --> 00:16:51,510
<font color="white">I was reading it! I was!</font><font color="white"></font>

229
00:17:00,060 --> 00:17:01,729
<font color="white">Young Master…</font><font color="white"></font>

230
00:17:17,911 --> 00:17:18,746
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

231
00:17:25,252 --> 00:17:26,211
<font color="white">Oh, surely not.</font><font color="white"></font>

232
00:17:26,920 --> 00:17:29,715
<font color="white">Did he really leave</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">just because I was a little bit late?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

233
00:17:47,316 --> 00:17:48,317
<font color="white">Miss…</font><font color="white"></font>

234
00:17:55,449 --> 00:17:57,326
<font color="white">Why were you not there last night?</font><font color="white"></font>

235
00:17:57,409 --> 00:17:58,243
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

236
00:17:59,411 --> 00:18:00,245
<font color="white">No, I…</font><font color="white"></font>

237
00:18:01,080 --> 00:18:03,332
<font color="white">I most certainly was there.</font><font color="white"></font>

238
00:18:03,415 --> 00:18:04,416
<font color="white">Of course you were.</font><font color="white"></font>

239
00:18:05,334 --> 00:18:07,002
<font color="white">You could not wait even a moment.</font><font color="white"></font>

240
00:18:09,463 --> 00:18:12,299
<font color="white">Very well. The fault was entirely mine.</font><font color="white"></font>

241
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:15,427
<font color="white">I have committed</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a most unforgivable offense!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

242
00:18:15,511 --> 00:18:18,305
<font color="white">No, I did not mean it was your fault.</font><font color="white"></font>

243
00:18:20,140 --> 00:18:21,350
<font color="white">You thought</font><font color="white"></font>

244
00:18:22,434 --> 00:18:24,728
<font color="white">you could simply disregard a girl like me.</font><font color="white"></font>

245
00:18:25,354 --> 00:18:27,523
<font color="white">Disregard? That is ridiculous.</font><font color="white"></font>

246
00:18:27,606 --> 00:18:29,525
<font color="white">-It is completely untrue.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-No, it is not!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

247
00:18:30,150 --> 00:18:32,653
<font color="white">You look down on me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">because I am but a concubine!</font><font color="white"></font></font>

248
00:18:44,123 --> 00:18:46,667
<font color="white">What do you mean, a concubine?</font><font color="white"></font>

249
00:18:48,293 --> 00:18:49,128
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

250
00:19:29,084 --> 00:19:30,878
<font color="white">-My lord.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Yes.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

251
00:19:51,940 --> 00:19:55,527
<font color="white">His Majesty summoned me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">on a matter of great importance.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

252
00:19:57,362 --> 00:20:00,699
<font color="white">On my way back from the palace,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I bought this for you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

253
00:20:01,408 --> 00:20:03,285
<font color="white">Oh, it is </font><font color="white"><font color="white"><i>yakgwa</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

254
00:20:04,369 --> 00:20:06,330
<font color="white">Thank you, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

255
00:20:06,955 --> 00:20:07,789
<font color="white">Of course.</font><font color="white"></font>

256
00:20:13,170 --> 00:20:14,463
<font color="white">-Say, "ah."</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-"Ah."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

257
00:20:24,640 --> 00:20:25,557
<font color="white">Now,</font><font color="white"></font>

258
00:20:25,641 --> 00:20:29,478
<font color="white">I must leave Bukchon for a short while.</font><font color="white"></font>

259
00:20:29,561 --> 00:20:30,437
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

260
00:20:30,979 --> 00:20:32,648
<font color="white">It should not take long.</font><font color="white"></font>

261
00:20:33,273 --> 00:20:34,399
<font color="white">So while I am away,</font><font color="white"></font>

262
00:20:34,483 --> 00:20:38,278
<font color="white">learn well the proper conduct of a lady</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">under my lady's guidance.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

263
00:20:40,614 --> 00:20:41,865
<font color="white">Once I return,</font><font color="white"></font>

264
00:20:42,741 --> 00:20:45,202
<font color="white">I shall make you my concubine at once.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Do you understand?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

265
00:20:45,702 --> 00:20:46,620
<font color="white">Really?</font><font color="white"></font>

266
00:20:46,703 --> 00:20:47,746
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

267
00:20:48,372 --> 00:20:50,374
<font color="white">Thank you, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

268
00:20:59,800 --> 00:21:01,426
<font color="white">This wretched hat…</font><font color="white"></font>

269
00:21:10,852 --> 00:21:14,147
<font color="white">His Majesty is holding Lady Hyegyeong's</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">60th birthday banquet in Hwaseong,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

270
00:21:15,274 --> 00:21:16,942
<font color="white">and the matter has been entrusted to me.</font><font color="white"></font>

271
00:21:18,860 --> 00:21:20,779
<font color="white">I shall show you without fail.</font><font color="white"></font>

272
00:21:20,862 --> 00:21:22,698
<font color="white">That I can firmly uphold the position</font><font color="white"></font>

273
00:21:23,949 --> 00:21:25,742
<font color="white">you have restored to me.</font><font color="white"></font>

274
00:21:35,544 --> 00:21:36,420
<font color="white">Dear cousin.</font><font color="white"></font>

275
00:21:37,379 --> 00:21:39,214
<font color="white">While your brother-in-law is away,</font><font color="white"></font>

276
00:21:39,298 --> 00:21:42,175
<font color="white">why not stay here for a time?</font><font color="white"></font>

277
00:21:42,259 --> 00:21:44,803
<font color="white">I imagine there is much you wish to ask.</font><font color="white"></font>

278
00:21:47,514 --> 00:21:50,434
<font color="white">What did the widow say?</font><font color="white"></font>

279
00:21:51,768 --> 00:21:53,770
<font color="white">How should I know?</font><font color="white"></font>

280
00:21:54,271 --> 00:21:56,648
<font color="white">Since sending that filthy letter,</font><font color="white"></font>

281
00:21:57,232 --> 00:22:00,694
<font color="white">I have not seen</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so much as the hem of her skirt.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

282
00:22:01,862 --> 00:22:02,696
<font color="white">Then again,</font><font color="white"></font>

283
00:22:03,697 --> 00:22:06,783
<font color="white">who could possibly know</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">the state of her heart now?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

284
00:22:08,535 --> 00:22:11,496
<font color="white">I only hope she has not altogether</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">lost her senses.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

285
00:22:13,498 --> 00:22:14,374
<font color="white">Well,</font><font color="white"></font>

286
00:22:15,083 --> 00:22:16,209
<font color="white">who knows?</font><font color="white"></font>

287
00:22:16,835 --> 00:22:18,545
<font color="white">She may have lost her senses so completely</font><font color="white"></font>

288
00:22:19,254 --> 00:22:21,590
<font color="white">that she secretly indulges in that letter.</font><font color="white"></font>

289
00:22:42,819 --> 00:22:45,072
<font color="white">I must become a refined woman now.</font><font color="white"></font>

290
00:22:46,323 --> 00:22:49,409
<font color="white">My So-ok has become a lady of Bukchon,</font><font color="white"></font>

291
00:22:49,493 --> 00:22:51,119
<font color="white">so I too must rise to the occasion.</font><font color="white"></font>

292
00:22:51,203 --> 00:22:52,245
<font color="white">Oh, my goodness.</font><font color="white"></font>

293
00:22:52,829 --> 00:22:55,207
<font color="white">You are more innocent than I thought.</font><font color="white"></font>

294
00:22:55,290 --> 00:22:59,461
<font color="white">If you knew how the ladies of Bukchon</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">truly amuse themselves,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

295
00:22:59,544 --> 00:23:00,712
<font color="white">you would faint away.</font><font color="white"></font>

296
00:23:00,796 --> 00:23:02,255
<font color="white">What does that matter?</font><font color="white"></font>

297
00:23:02,339 --> 00:23:03,381
<font color="white">Have you heard?</font><font color="white"></font>

298
00:23:03,924 --> 00:23:06,218
<font color="white">Choi was cast out</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of the Chief State Councilor's house.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

299
00:23:06,301 --> 00:23:09,513
<font color="white">I heard the councilor warned him</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">never to set foot in Bukchon again.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

300
00:23:10,472 --> 00:23:12,265
<font color="white">What on earth did he do?</font><font color="white"></font>

301
00:23:12,349 --> 00:23:13,934
<font color="white">The youngest son of that house</font><font color="white"></font>

302
00:23:15,644 --> 00:23:17,562
<font color="white">turned out to be left-handed.</font><font color="white"></font>

303
00:23:17,646 --> 00:23:20,148
<font color="white">Just like Choi.</font><font color="white"></font>

304
00:23:20,857 --> 00:23:22,734
<font color="white">It was his seed, then?</font><font color="white"></font>

305
00:23:23,276 --> 00:23:25,362
<font color="white">My, my.</font><font color="white"></font>

306
00:23:25,445 --> 00:23:28,490
<font color="white">What sort of place is Bukchon</font><font color="white"></font>

307
00:23:28,573 --> 00:23:30,951
<font color="white">that such amusing scandals</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">break out every day?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

308
00:23:34,287 --> 00:23:37,457
<font color="white">Madam, Lord Cho Won is here.</font><font color="white"></font>

309
00:23:37,541 --> 00:23:38,917
<font color="white">Yes, send him in…</font><font color="white"></font>

310
00:23:39,543 --> 00:23:40,710
<font color="white">What?</font><font color="white"></font>

311
00:23:40,794 --> 00:23:42,921
<font color="white">What… What did you say?</font><font color="white"></font>

312
00:23:51,888 --> 00:23:52,722
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

313
00:23:54,015 --> 00:23:57,644
<font color="white">It seems the tobacco</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I let you sample pleased you after all.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

314
00:23:58,603 --> 00:24:01,022
<font color="white">I could not forget the taste,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so I came for more.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

315
00:24:02,774 --> 00:24:05,819
<font color="white">Yet amidst the fragrance of flowers</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in full bloom here,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

316
00:24:08,989 --> 00:24:11,783
<font color="white">I can hardly recall the scent</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of the tobacco I meant to buy.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

317
00:24:13,076 --> 00:24:13,952
<font color="white">Oh, my.</font><font color="white"></font>

318
00:24:15,078 --> 00:24:16,204
<font color="white">Off with you now.</font><font color="white"></font>

319
00:24:17,330 --> 00:24:19,082
<font color="white">I must attend to my esteemed guest.</font><font color="white"></font>

320
00:24:22,210 --> 00:24:23,545
<font color="white">Bun-hui.</font><font color="white"></font>

321
00:24:27,841 --> 00:24:29,801
<font color="white">Go on now. Quickly.</font><font color="white"></font>

322
00:24:53,783 --> 00:24:56,244
<font color="white">It has been so long</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">since I sent that letter.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

323
00:24:56,328 --> 00:24:58,455
<font color="white">When you did not come to see me,</font><font color="white"></font>

324
00:24:59,706 --> 00:25:02,125
<font color="white">I thought my heart would break.</font><font color="white"></font>

325
00:25:04,669 --> 00:25:07,214
<font color="white">So that is why you dared send</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">such an audacious letter</font><font color="white"></font></font>

326
00:25:07,964 --> 00:25:09,674
<font color="white">without a shred of fear.</font><font color="white"></font>

327
00:25:17,390 --> 00:25:20,769
<font color="white">Did you not once say you liked me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">because I feared nothing?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

328
00:25:20,852 --> 00:25:24,606
<font color="white">That is how I came to be held</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so tightly in your arms.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

329
00:25:25,106 --> 00:25:26,524
<font color="white">And in the end,</font><font color="white"></font>

330
00:25:27,317 --> 00:25:30,445
<font color="white">was it not that very letter</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that brought you back to me now?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

331
00:25:35,867 --> 00:25:36,868
<font color="white">You…</font><font color="white"></font>

332
00:25:38,370 --> 00:25:42,040
<font color="white">You do not realize what you are scribbling</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">with that reckless brush of yours,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

333
00:25:43,041 --> 00:25:44,334
<font color="white">or how greatly</font><font color="white"></font>

334
00:25:45,377 --> 00:25:47,671
<font color="white">that scrap of paper might trouble me.</font><font color="white"></font>

335
00:25:47,754 --> 00:25:49,714
<font color="white">You never pause to think of such things.</font><font color="white"></font>

336
00:25:55,804 --> 00:25:56,638
<font color="white">Bun-hui.</font><font color="white"></font>

337
00:25:59,349 --> 00:26:00,725
<font color="white">It is</font><font color="white"></font>

338
00:26:00,809 --> 00:26:04,312
<font color="white">that long, wet tongue of yours</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">that always worries me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

339
00:26:09,317 --> 00:26:12,195
<font color="white">Wag it carelessly, and it may well</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">tighten the noose around your own neck.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

340
00:26:13,697 --> 00:26:14,614
<font color="white">And yet</font><font color="white"></font>

341
00:26:15,782 --> 00:26:19,619
<font color="white">all you care for</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">is indulging yourself in the thrill of it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

342
00:26:24,582 --> 00:26:28,086
<font color="white">You speak as though</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">your very life hung upon my little letter.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

343
00:26:34,217 --> 00:26:35,677
<font color="white">Bun-hui.</font><font color="white"></font>

344
00:26:36,720 --> 00:26:38,763
<font color="white">If you care at all for your daughter,</font><font color="white"></font>

345
00:26:40,307 --> 00:26:43,143
<font color="white">then from now on</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you must at least feign modesty.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

346
00:26:46,438 --> 00:26:48,231
<font color="white">Only then may you peek over the walls</font><font color="white"></font>

347
00:26:48,315 --> 00:26:50,525
<font color="white">of the scholar-official households</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you so admire.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

348
00:26:51,234 --> 00:26:52,777
<font color="white">And only then may you set foot</font><font color="white"></font>

349
00:26:53,695 --> 00:26:56,573
<font color="white">in the gatherings</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of those noblewomen you envy so dearly.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

350
00:27:04,581 --> 00:27:08,084
<font color="white">If you wish to enter Bukchon,</font><font color="white"></font>

351
00:27:11,963 --> 00:27:13,381
<font color="white">you must pretend</font><font color="white"></font>

352
00:27:14,674 --> 00:27:16,301
<font color="white">not to hear what you hear,</font><font color="white"></font>

353
00:27:19,179 --> 00:27:20,513
<font color="white">and not to see what you see.</font><font color="white"></font>

354
00:27:38,239 --> 00:27:39,532
<font color="white">Keep that in mind, Bun-hui.</font><font color="white"></font>

355
00:27:58,176 --> 00:28:00,553
<font color="white">My lord! Forgive me.</font><font color="white"></font>

356
00:28:01,513 --> 00:28:02,806
<font color="white">Forgive me.</font><font color="white"></font>

357
00:28:02,889 --> 00:28:04,808
<font color="white">My mother is poor with the brush,</font><font color="white"></font>

358
00:28:04,891 --> 00:28:06,851
<font color="white">so I always copy her letters in the end.</font><font color="white"></font>

359
00:28:06,935 --> 00:28:09,771
<font color="white">If the letter displeased you,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I apologize in her stead.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

360
00:28:10,939 --> 00:28:13,441
<font color="white">This matter</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">shall never pass beyond these walls</font><font color="white"></font></font>

361
00:28:13,525 --> 00:28:15,652
<font color="white">for as long as I live.</font><font color="white"></font>

362
00:28:15,735 --> 00:28:17,487
<font color="white">I swear it to you, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

363
00:28:19,447 --> 00:28:20,323
<font color="white">Your mother…</font><font color="white"></font>

364
00:28:22,659 --> 00:28:26,913
<font color="white">had you, her own daughter,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">copy such a letter for her?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

365
00:28:32,544 --> 00:28:34,087
<font color="white">She is not my birth mother.</font><font color="white"></font>

366
00:28:34,921 --> 00:28:38,258
<font color="white">She still stands in my mother's place,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">so I had no choice but to copy it.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

367
00:28:38,341 --> 00:28:41,428
<font color="white">But that woman is so filthy</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">I wish I had nothing to do with her.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

368
00:28:58,820 --> 00:28:59,946
<font color="white">Your mother</font><font color="white"></font>

369
00:29:00,905 --> 00:29:03,366
<font color="white">seems to know paintings rather well.</font><font color="white"></font>

370
00:29:04,075 --> 00:29:05,702
<font color="white">Do you have an eye for them as well?</font><font color="white"></font>

371
00:29:05,785 --> 00:29:06,619
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

372
00:29:08,371 --> 00:29:10,457
<font color="white">I know little of what is fine or poor.</font><font color="white"></font>

373
00:29:10,540 --> 00:29:12,917
<font color="white">I only know what fetches a price.</font><font color="white"></font>

374
00:29:14,627 --> 00:29:15,545
<font color="white">Is that so?</font><font color="white"></font>

375
00:29:16,796 --> 00:29:19,716
<font color="white">Then what do you think of this painting?</font><font color="white"></font>

376
00:29:20,675 --> 00:29:22,427
<font color="white">Would it fetch a handsome sum?</font><font color="white"></font>

377
00:29:25,096 --> 00:29:28,183
<font color="white">The peonies seem to be swaying</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">in the spring breeze,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

378
00:29:28,266 --> 00:29:31,478
<font color="white">so lifelike that their fragrance</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">seems to rise from them.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

379
00:29:33,062 --> 00:29:36,441
<font color="white">And this little bud hidden behind the leaf</font><font color="white"></font>

380
00:29:36,524 --> 00:29:40,445
<font color="white">is so charming,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">it makes one wish to tap it with a finger.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

381
00:29:43,531 --> 00:29:46,826
<font color="white">My lord has long been away from court,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and the affair entrusted to him</font><font color="white"></font></font>

382
00:29:46,910 --> 00:29:48,745
<font color="white">is of the utmost importance.</font><font color="white"></font>

383
00:30:00,882 --> 00:30:01,758
<font color="white">Here.</font><font color="white"></font>

384
00:30:02,300 --> 00:30:04,260
<font color="white">If you and I were to finish</font><font color="white"></font>

385
00:30:04,344 --> 00:30:07,639
<font color="white">this peony painting together</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and present it to him upon his return,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

386
00:30:07,722 --> 00:30:10,350
<font color="white">it would be</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a most wonderful act of devotion.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

387
00:30:12,811 --> 00:30:16,105
<font color="white">Your handwriting was so firm and elegant</font><font color="white"></font>

388
00:30:16,189 --> 00:30:18,191
<font color="white">that I greatly admired it.</font><font color="white"></font>

389
00:30:18,775 --> 00:30:21,820
<font color="white">Fill it with your writing.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">Anything you wish.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

390
00:30:48,847 --> 00:30:53,935
<font color="white">THE PEONIES IN FULL BLOSSOM…</font><font color="white"></font>

391
00:31:01,192 --> 00:31:04,237
<font color="white">THE PEONIES IN FULL BLOSSOM,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">HOW COULD THEY BE…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

392
00:31:06,447 --> 00:31:08,533
<font color="white">This handwriting feels different.</font><font color="white"></font>

393
00:31:09,868 --> 00:31:12,203
<font color="white">Quite unlike the one you used</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for </font><font color="white"></font><font color="white"><i>Elementary Learning</i></font></font><font color="white"><font color="white">.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

394
00:31:12,829 --> 00:31:15,623
<font color="white">To think you could instantly fashion</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">an entirely new style</font><font color="white"></font></font>

395
00:31:16,124 --> 00:31:18,501
<font color="white">so well suited to this peony painting.</font><font color="white"></font>

396
00:31:19,878 --> 00:31:23,256
<font color="white">It seems I have brought</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">quite a remarkable lady into my household.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

397
00:31:33,349 --> 00:31:34,851
<font color="white">I deserve to die!</font><font color="white"></font>

398
00:31:35,435 --> 00:31:37,103
<font color="white">Please have mercy on me, my lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

399
00:31:38,438 --> 00:31:42,025
<font color="white">In truth, it was not I who wrote it.</font><font color="white"></font>

400
00:31:42,108 --> 00:31:44,110
<font color="white">Young Master In-ho wrote it for me.</font><font color="white"></font>

401
00:31:47,071 --> 00:31:50,825
<font color="white">You mean Young Master Kwon In-ho</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of the Left State Councilor's house?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

402
00:31:50,909 --> 00:31:52,493
<font color="white">Please spare me… No.</font><font color="white"></font>

403
00:31:53,119 --> 00:31:55,580
<font color="white">Just kill me instead.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">How dare a mere concubine…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

404
00:31:59,500 --> 00:32:02,378
<font color="white">But it is all over now.</font><font color="white"></font>

405
00:32:03,630 --> 00:32:06,758
<font color="white">The young master</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">already learned that I am a concubine,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

406
00:32:06,841 --> 00:32:07,717
<font color="white">so…</font><font color="white"></font>

407
00:32:08,509 --> 00:32:09,636
<font color="white">So…</font><font color="white"></font>

408
00:32:17,018 --> 00:32:18,311
<font color="white">Poor thing.</font><font color="white"></font>

409
00:32:19,854 --> 00:32:23,399
<font color="white">Your heart must have been heavy,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">preparing to give yourself to my lord</font><font color="white"></font></font>

410
00:32:23,900 --> 00:32:26,110
<font color="white">while carrying feelings for another.</font><font color="white"></font>

411
00:32:32,075 --> 00:32:33,201
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

412
00:32:33,284 --> 00:32:35,036
<font color="white">And after learning who you were,</font><font color="white"></font>

413
00:32:35,119 --> 00:32:37,372
<font color="white">did Young Master In-ho</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">pretend not to know you?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

414
00:32:37,455 --> 00:32:41,209
<font color="white">I have not seen him since.</font><font color="white"></font>

415
00:32:48,883 --> 00:32:53,471
<font color="white">I fear your heart, delicate as a flower,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">may have been wounded.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

416
00:32:58,309 --> 00:33:02,897
<font color="white">As long as you do not neglect</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">your duty in serving my lord,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

417
00:33:03,898 --> 00:33:06,192
<font color="white">I can overlook such a matter.</font><font color="white"></font>

418
00:33:08,778 --> 00:33:11,948
<font color="white">I know well enough how harsh life can be</font><font color="white"></font>

419
00:33:12,448 --> 00:33:13,950
<font color="white">for a woman in Bukchon.</font><font color="white"></font>

420
00:33:15,994 --> 00:33:17,161
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

421
00:33:17,996 --> 00:33:22,667
<font color="white">But surely no one else knows of this?</font><font color="white"></font>

422
00:33:22,750 --> 00:33:24,043
<font color="white">No one besides Mal-ttong…</font><font color="white"></font>

423
00:33:27,505 --> 00:33:28,840
<font color="white">In truth,</font><font color="white"></font>

424
00:33:29,966 --> 00:33:32,468
<font color="white">Lord Cho Won knows a little of it as well.</font><font color="white"></font>

425
00:33:37,557 --> 00:33:38,558
<font color="white">Oh, dear!</font><font color="white"></font>

426
00:33:44,022 --> 00:33:45,189
<font color="white">Go to him.</font><font color="white"></font>

427
00:33:45,732 --> 00:33:46,566
<font color="white">Pardon?</font><font color="white"></font>

428
00:33:46,649 --> 00:33:48,317
<font color="white">Go and plead your case to him.</font><font color="white"></font>

429
00:33:50,111 --> 00:33:51,779
<font color="white">He is a man who knows spring.</font><font color="white"></font>

430
00:33:53,698 --> 00:33:56,159
<font color="white">If he hears your heartfelt plea,</font><font color="white"></font>

431
00:33:57,035 --> 00:34:00,329
<font color="white">he shall surely turn a blind eye,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">no matter his relation to my husband.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

432
00:34:00,413 --> 00:34:04,333
<font color="white">Do you truly think so?</font><font color="white"></font>

433
00:34:05,334 --> 00:34:06,502
<font color="white">Who knows?</font><font color="white"></font>

434
00:34:07,587 --> 00:34:11,716
<font color="white">He may even become a bridge</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">between you and Young Master In-ho.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

435
00:34:38,076 --> 00:34:39,202
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

436
00:34:40,912 --> 00:34:44,415
<font color="white">Well, there is something I must tell you.</font><font color="white"></font>

437
00:34:44,499 --> 00:34:45,333
<font color="white">Now?</font><font color="white"></font>

438
00:34:46,542 --> 00:34:47,376
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

439
00:34:51,339 --> 00:34:52,215
<font color="white">Very well.</font><font color="white"></font>

440
00:35:03,476 --> 00:35:04,435
<font color="white">A favor, you say?</font><font color="white"></font>

441
00:35:05,895 --> 00:35:08,189
<font color="white">Then this may take some time.</font><font color="white"></font>

442
00:35:10,817 --> 00:35:11,734
<font color="white">Would it be wise</font><font color="white"></font>

443
00:35:12,568 --> 00:35:14,695
<font color="white">to leave your shoes outside so plainly?</font><font color="white"></font>

444
00:35:15,696 --> 00:35:16,572
<font color="white">Huh?</font><font color="white"></font>

445
00:35:20,201 --> 00:35:21,160
<font color="white">What I mean is,</font><font color="white"></font>

446
00:35:23,121 --> 00:35:27,208
<font color="white">should anyone see you here,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">would that not pose a problem?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

447
00:35:41,097 --> 00:35:42,098
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

448
00:35:52,567 --> 00:35:54,402
<font color="white">The young master has learned</font><font color="white"></font>

449
00:35:54,986 --> 00:35:56,696
<font color="white">that I am a concubine in this house.</font><font color="white"></font>

450
00:35:56,779 --> 00:35:59,407
<font color="white">-You had hidden it from him?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-Not deliberately.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

451
00:36:00,449 --> 00:36:01,325
<font color="white">In any case,</font><font color="white"></font>

452
00:36:02,827 --> 00:36:06,497
<font color="white">what should I write</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to earn his forgiveness?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

453
00:36:07,582 --> 00:36:09,125
<font color="white">Well, you…</font><font color="white"></font>

454
00:36:11,335 --> 00:36:13,671
<font color="white">You do resemble her somewhat.</font><font color="white"></font>

455
00:36:14,380 --> 00:36:15,423
<font color="white">Whom?</font><font color="white"></font>

456
00:36:20,303 --> 00:36:21,596
<font color="white">Someone I know.</font><font color="white"></font>

457
00:36:22,388 --> 00:36:23,472
<font color="white">How shall I put it?</font><font color="white"></font>

458
00:36:23,556 --> 00:36:25,474
<font color="white">A true master in such matters, perhaps?</font><font color="white"></font>

459
00:36:27,185 --> 00:36:28,019
<font color="white">A true master?</font><font color="white"></font>

460
00:36:32,857 --> 00:36:34,233
<font color="white">"How could you…</font><font color="white"></font>

461
00:36:36,903 --> 00:36:40,156
<font color="white">leave after merely brushing my shoulder?"</font><font color="white"></font>

462
00:36:44,493 --> 00:36:47,747
<font color="white">"Thoughts of you leave me breathless…</font><font color="white"></font>

463
00:36:49,832 --> 00:36:51,417
<font color="white">and I spent the night</font><font color="white"></font>

464
00:36:52,960 --> 00:36:54,420
<font color="white">thoroughly drenched."</font><font color="white"></font>

465
00:36:55,004 --> 00:36:56,214
<font color="white">"Breath…"</font><font color="white"></font>

466
00:36:57,215 --> 00:36:58,633
<font color="white">My lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

467
00:37:01,594 --> 00:37:03,930
<font color="white">How does one write "breathless"?</font><font color="white"></font>

468
00:37:05,056 --> 00:37:07,516
<font color="white">Is there an "E" after "T-H"?</font><font color="white"></font>

469
00:37:15,733 --> 00:37:16,734
<font color="white">Good.</font><font color="white"></font>

470
00:37:21,822 --> 00:37:23,199
<font color="white">You are writing it correctly.</font><font color="white"></font>

471
00:37:33,251 --> 00:37:35,670
<font color="white">"My thighs seem to part</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">of their own accord…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

472
00:37:40,258 --> 00:37:44,053
<font color="white">yet there are no great hands</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to spread them further."</font><font color="white"></font></font>

473
00:37:47,932 --> 00:37:48,849
<font color="white">"Tonight…</font><font color="white"></font>

474
00:37:53,062 --> 00:37:55,231
<font color="white">I long for you, Young Master."</font><font color="white"></font>

475
00:38:09,495 --> 00:38:10,913
<font color="white">"When next we meet…</font><font color="white"></font>

476
00:38:16,377 --> 00:38:18,963
<font color="white">scold this drenched little thing of mine."</font><font color="white"></font>

477
00:38:28,014 --> 00:38:29,640
<font color="white">"I beg of you."</font><font color="white"></font>

478
00:39:01,881 --> 00:39:02,757
<font color="white">Now…</font><font color="white"></font>

479
00:39:05,343 --> 00:39:06,844
<font color="white">what will you do next?</font><font color="white"></font>

480
00:39:10,264 --> 00:39:13,059
<font color="white">Pretend I am Young Master In-ho</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and show me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

481
00:39:14,393 --> 00:39:18,105
<font color="white">What must be done to soothe his anger?</font><font color="white"></font>

482
00:39:53,349 --> 00:39:54,392
<font color="white">Young Master.</font><font color="white"></font>

483
00:40:05,861 --> 00:40:07,321
<font color="white">It is I, So-ok.</font><font color="white"></font>

484
00:40:09,782 --> 00:40:10,741
<font color="white">Young Master.</font><font color="white"></font>

485
00:40:14,995 --> 00:40:15,996
<font color="white">Young…</font><font color="white"></font>

486
00:40:16,831 --> 00:40:17,665
<font color="white">Wait.</font><font color="white"></font>

487
00:40:19,041 --> 00:40:21,043
<font color="white">Do not go, Young Master!</font><font color="white"></font>

488
00:40:24,255 --> 00:40:25,423
<font color="white">Miss!</font><font color="white"></font>

489
00:40:26,757 --> 00:40:27,883
<font color="white">What…</font><font color="white"></font>

490
00:40:29,760 --> 00:40:32,888
<font color="white">-What manner of madness is this?</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-It is I, So-ok.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

491
00:40:33,389 --> 00:40:35,433
<font color="white">-So-ok.</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-A concubine?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

492
00:40:39,562 --> 00:40:41,856
<font color="white">From the day I could no longer see you,</font><font color="white"></font>

493
00:40:43,315 --> 00:40:46,777
<font color="white">I have not slept a wink</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">for thoughts of you.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

494
00:40:48,779 --> 00:40:49,613
<font color="white">Miss.</font><font color="white"></font>

495
00:40:53,492 --> 00:40:56,412
<font color="white">There is not</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">a shred of falsehood in those words,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

496
00:40:57,371 --> 00:40:58,372
<font color="white">is there?</font><font color="white"></font>

497
00:41:21,270 --> 00:41:22,438
<font color="white">I have been the same.</font><font color="white"></font>

498
00:41:23,397 --> 00:41:24,732
<font color="white">I too</font><font color="white"></font>

499
00:41:31,530 --> 00:41:33,199
<font color="white">have spent…</font><font color="white"></font>

500
00:41:35,910 --> 00:41:38,078
<font color="white">sleepless nights in agony,</font><font color="white"></font>

501
00:41:38,162 --> 00:41:40,623
<font color="white">my heart torn apart by thoughts of you.</font><font color="white"></font>

502
00:42:28,003 --> 00:42:30,339
<font color="white">This night of ours…</font><font color="white"></font>

503
00:42:32,967 --> 00:42:34,927
<font color="white">that we tucked away…</font><font color="white"></font>

504
00:42:37,721 --> 00:42:39,056
<font color="white">in such longing…</font><font color="white"></font>

505
00:42:41,559 --> 00:42:44,186
<font color="white">I wish to unfold it here and now.</font><font color="white"></font>

506
00:42:47,648 --> 00:42:49,483
<font color="white">Then do so, Young Master.</font><font color="white"></font>

507
00:42:52,653 --> 00:42:54,613
<font color="white">Unfold it as you please.</font><font color="white"></font>

508
00:42:56,574 --> 00:42:58,033
<font color="white">I wish for it too.</font><font color="white"></font>

509
00:43:13,882 --> 00:43:15,092
<font color="white">Good.</font><font color="white"></font>

510
00:43:16,510 --> 00:43:19,096
<font color="white">We are nearly there now, Miss.</font><font color="white"></font>

511
00:43:22,016 --> 00:43:22,975
<font color="white">Young Master.</font><font color="white"></font>

512
00:43:24,310 --> 00:43:26,103
<font color="white">The Young Master In-ho you longed for</font><font color="white"></font>

513
00:43:27,062 --> 00:43:28,314
<font color="white">is here before you.</font><font color="white"></font>

514
00:43:31,483 --> 00:43:33,110
<font color="white">It is I, So-ok.</font><font color="white"></font>

515
00:43:45,456 --> 00:43:46,665
<font color="white">Miss.</font><font color="white"></font>

516
00:43:51,337 --> 00:43:52,338
<font color="white">There.</font><font color="white"></font>

517
00:44:11,148 --> 00:44:12,107
<font color="white">Your hand.</font><font color="white"></font>

518
00:44:15,069 --> 00:44:15,903
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

519
00:44:17,112 --> 00:44:20,157
<font color="white">I wish for it too, Young Master.</font><font color="white"></font>

520
00:44:21,116 --> 00:44:22,743
<font color="white">Yes, Miss.</font><font color="white"></font>

521
00:44:24,620 --> 00:44:25,788
<font color="white">Young Master.</font><font color="white"></font>

522
00:44:33,962 --> 00:44:34,797
<font color="white">Wait…</font><font color="white"></font>

523
00:44:39,051 --> 00:44:40,010
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

524
00:44:47,142 --> 00:44:50,104
<font color="white"><i>Regarding that flower bud</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>you sent me last night.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

525
00:44:50,187 --> 00:44:53,440
<font color="white"><i>Before I could even lay a hand upon her,</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>she was already baring herself.</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

526
00:44:53,524 --> 00:44:54,858
<font color="white"><i>I nearly lost my senses</i></font><font color="white"></font>

527
00:44:54,942 --> 00:44:57,528
<font color="white"><i>-and let the matter end too easily.</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white">-It is So-ok, my lady.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

528
00:44:58,237 --> 00:44:59,488
<font color="white"><i>But you know me.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

529
00:45:00,155 --> 00:45:02,449
<font color="white"><i>If I were simply to grant you</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>what you desire,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

530
00:45:03,117 --> 00:45:06,245
<font color="white"><i>our wager would become rather pointless.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

531
00:45:06,328 --> 00:45:07,871
<font color="white"><i>So I barely managed to send her away.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

532
00:45:09,415 --> 00:45:11,041
<font color="white">Did you sleep well through the night?</font><font color="white"></font>

533
00:45:11,125 --> 00:45:13,752
<font color="white"><i>I shall now devote myself</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>to my true objective,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

534
00:45:13,836 --> 00:45:15,879
<font color="white"><i>conquering the widow.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

535
00:45:17,047 --> 00:45:18,298
<font color="white"><i>Watch and see.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

536
00:45:18,799 --> 00:45:21,260
<font color="white"><i>I shall claim without fail</i></font><font color="white">
<font color="white"><i>the reward you promised me,</i></font></font><font color="white"></font>

537
00:45:21,343 --> 00:45:23,387
<font color="white"><i>the one I could never refuse.</i></font><font color="white"></font>

538
00:45:25,639 --> 00:45:26,515
<font color="white">Let me see that.</font><font color="white"></font>

539
00:45:32,980 --> 00:45:33,981
<font color="white">Oh, here.</font><font color="white"></font>

540
00:45:35,524 --> 00:45:39,027
<font color="white">LIQUOR</font><font color="white"></font>

541
00:45:45,200 --> 00:45:49,204
<font color="white">"It was only for idle amusement…"</font><font color="white"></font>

542
00:45:51,582 --> 00:45:53,542
<font color="white">What took you so long?</font><font color="white"></font>

543
00:45:53,625 --> 00:45:57,087
<font color="white">You rascal,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">since when have you ever waited for me?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

544
00:45:57,671 --> 00:46:00,299
<font color="white">Here. Take this to the lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

545
00:46:00,382 --> 00:46:02,676
<font color="white">She has left,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and she took Eun-sil with her.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

546
00:46:05,304 --> 00:46:07,222
<font color="white">I hear she's gone</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to her family home in Hwaseong.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

547
00:46:07,306 --> 00:46:08,932
<font color="white">I wonder what happened all of a sudden.</font><font color="white"></font>

548
00:46:36,793 --> 00:46:37,794
<font color="white">Last night,</font><font color="white"></font>

549
00:46:39,421 --> 00:46:42,549
<font color="white">your late father appeared in my dream.</font><font color="white"></font>

550
00:46:43,967 --> 00:46:45,344
<font color="white">He held my hand tightly</font><font color="white"></font>

551
00:46:47,221 --> 00:46:50,307
<font color="white">and said he wished to see you.</font><font color="white"></font>

552
00:47:22,172 --> 00:47:23,298
<font color="white">I suppose</font><font color="white"></font>

553
00:47:24,174 --> 00:47:26,385
<font color="white">he longs for you dearly from there.</font><font color="white"></font>

554
00:47:31,557 --> 00:47:33,809
<font color="white">Go pay a visit to your family home.</font><font color="white"></font>

555
00:49:25,087 --> 00:49:26,755
<font color="white">Eun-sil!</font><font color="white"></font>

556
00:49:28,882 --> 00:49:29,841
<font color="white">Eun-sil!</font><font color="white"></font>

557
00:49:32,427 --> 00:49:33,261
<font color="white">Eun-sil!</font><font color="white"></font>

558
00:49:36,598 --> 00:49:38,433
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

559
00:49:39,559 --> 00:49:41,144
<font color="white">My lady!</font><font color="white"></font>

560
00:49:42,771 --> 00:49:43,897
<font color="white">The lord has come.</font><font color="white"></font>

561
00:49:45,148 --> 00:49:46,274
<font color="white">The lord!</font><font color="white"></font>

562
00:49:47,109 --> 00:49:48,985
<font color="white">Lord Cho Won has come all the way here.</font><font color="white"></font>

563
00:49:54,199 --> 00:49:55,409
<font color="white">My lady.</font><font color="white"></font>

564
00:50:17,723 --> 00:50:20,267
<font color="white">Oh, all right.</font><font color="white"></font>

565
00:50:20,851 --> 00:50:22,644
<font color="white">What? Come now.</font><font color="white"></font>

566
00:50:22,728 --> 00:50:23,895
<font color="white">Why, you…</font><font color="white"></font>

567
00:50:24,563 --> 00:50:25,439
<font color="white">Oh, there she is.</font><font color="white"></font>

568
00:50:30,444 --> 00:50:31,570
<font color="white">Well…</font><font color="white"></font>

569
00:50:32,362 --> 00:50:35,073
<font color="white">Did you tell the lady I was here?</font><font color="white"></font>

570
00:50:35,782 --> 00:50:36,616
<font color="white">Yes.</font><font color="white"></font>

571
00:50:36,700 --> 00:50:40,120
<font color="white">Right, and what did she say?</font><font color="white"></font>

572
00:50:40,203 --> 00:50:41,913
<font color="white">She said</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">she never wishes to see you again,</font><font color="white"></font></font>

573
00:50:43,081 --> 00:50:44,916
<font color="white">so you are to leave.</font><font color="white"></font>

574
00:50:45,000 --> 00:50:46,460
<font color="white">Well, that's…</font><font color="white"></font>

575
00:50:47,669 --> 00:50:48,545
<font color="white">No, that…</font><font color="white"></font>

576
00:50:50,380 --> 00:50:51,298
<font color="white">That cannot be right.</font><font color="white"></font>

577
00:50:52,966 --> 00:50:54,718
<font color="white">It cannot.</font><font color="white"></font>

578
00:50:57,012 --> 00:50:58,013
<font color="white">Go bring her.</font><font color="white"></font>

579
00:50:58,096 --> 00:50:59,556
<font color="white">Go and tell her this.</font><font color="white"></font>

580
00:51:01,641 --> 00:51:03,310
<font color="white">Until she agrees to see me,</font><font color="white"></font>

581
00:51:03,977 --> 00:51:04,853
<font color="white">I shall not</font><font color="white"></font>

582
00:51:06,021 --> 00:51:08,190
<font color="white">take a single step from this place!</font><font color="white"></font>

583
00:51:08,273 --> 00:51:10,275
<font color="white">She chose to leave me without a word,</font><font color="white"></font>

584
00:51:10,358 --> 00:51:11,568
<font color="white">so I too shall do as I please</font><font color="white"></font>

585
00:51:12,778 --> 00:51:14,029
<font color="white">and wait for her here.</font><font color="white"></font>

586
00:51:14,613 --> 00:51:16,448
<font color="white">Repeat every word exactly as I said it.</font><font color="white"></font>

587
00:51:16,531 --> 00:51:18,950
<font color="white">My lord, please stop this and go at once.</font><font color="white"></font>

588
00:51:19,034 --> 00:51:22,621
<font color="white">What if an elder of her family sees you?</font><font color="white"></font>

589
00:51:22,704 --> 00:51:23,789
<font color="white">Forgive me.</font><font color="white"></font>

590
00:51:27,751 --> 00:51:29,836
<font color="white">Hey! Go deliver my words at once!</font><font color="white"></font>

591
00:52:12,546 --> 00:52:16,174
<font color="white">If you mean to go on like this,</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">you may as well go see the lord outside.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

592
00:52:20,345 --> 00:52:22,097
<font color="white">He still has not left.</font><font color="white"></font>

593
00:52:24,015 --> 00:52:26,226
<font color="white">He may well freeze to death</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">out there in the rain soon.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

594
00:52:40,907 --> 00:52:43,285
<font color="white">Go back in! Go!</font><font color="white"></font>

595
00:52:43,368 --> 00:52:45,412
<font color="white">Go! Quickly!</font><font color="white"></font>

596
00:52:54,588 --> 00:52:56,256
<font color="white">Why did that scoundrel Cho Won</font><font color="white"></font>

597
00:52:56,756 --> 00:53:01,011
<font color="white">have you write a letter</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">to explain that earlier one?</font><font color="white"></font></font>

598
00:53:01,678 --> 00:53:02,846
<font color="white">That is what I'm asking.</font><font color="white"></font>

599
00:53:02,929 --> 00:53:05,682
<font color="white">Mother, I tell you. I truly know nothing.</font><font color="white"></font>

600
00:53:06,516 --> 00:53:09,519
<font color="white">Lord Cho Won glared at me</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">as though he would kill me</font><font color="white"></font></font>

601
00:53:09,603 --> 00:53:11,271
<font color="white">and said if I did not write it at once,</font><font color="white"></font>

602
00:53:11,354 --> 00:53:13,356
<font color="white">he would bring great disgrace</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">upon this household.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

603
00:53:14,524 --> 00:53:19,112
<font color="white">I only feared some misfortune</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">might come upon you, Mother.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

604
00:53:20,447 --> 00:53:22,324
<font color="white">That is why I did as he commanded.</font><font color="white"></font>

605
00:53:23,450 --> 00:53:25,243
<font color="white">Think on it, Mother.</font><font color="white"></font>

606
00:53:25,785 --> 00:53:28,413
<font color="white">He is a nobleman. To a girl like me…</font><font color="white"></font>

607
00:53:29,414 --> 00:53:32,626
<font color="white">Yes, just as you always say,</font><font color="white"></font>

608
00:53:32,709 --> 00:53:35,170
<font color="white">a completely witless girl.</font><font color="white"></font>

609
00:53:36,588 --> 00:53:37,923
<font color="white">For heaven's sake.</font><font color="white"></font>

610
00:53:38,006 --> 00:53:39,799
<font color="white">Why would he explain his reasons to me?</font><font color="white"></font>

611
00:53:41,509 --> 00:53:44,262
<font color="white">I only did as I was told, Mother!</font><font color="white"></font>

612
00:53:44,346 --> 00:53:45,722
<font color="white">Please believe me!</font><font color="white"></font>

613
00:53:49,059 --> 00:53:50,518
<font color="white">Go pay So-ok a visit.</font><font color="white"></font>

614
00:53:52,062 --> 00:53:53,521
<font color="white">So-ok? Why?</font><font color="white"></font>

615
00:53:54,189 --> 00:53:56,691
<font color="white">That is Cho Won's cousin's house,</font><font color="white"></font>

616
00:53:56,775 --> 00:53:59,736
<font color="white">so go there</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">and listen for anything you can.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

617
00:53:59,819 --> 00:54:01,613
<font color="white">I must know why that man</font><font color="white"></font>

618
00:54:01,696 --> 00:54:04,157
<font color="white">had you do such a thing!</font><font color="white"></font>

619
00:54:06,284 --> 00:54:08,078
<font color="white">Even for but a moment,</font><font color="white"></font>

620
00:54:09,829 --> 00:54:12,582
<font color="white">would you let me see your face?</font><font color="white"></font>

621
00:54:15,502 --> 00:54:17,003
<font color="white">I shall wait here!</font><font color="white"></font>

622
00:54:39,192 --> 00:54:40,860
<font color="white">My heart is here with you…</font><font color="white"></font>

623
00:54:45,073 --> 00:54:46,616
<font color="white">yet I cannot show it.</font><font color="white"></font>

624
00:55:04,843 --> 00:55:06,302
<font color="white">Hey, Chil-seong!</font><font color="white"></font>

625
00:55:06,386 --> 00:55:07,220
<font color="white">The letter!</font><font color="white"></font>

626
00:55:13,643 --> 00:55:14,561
<font color="white">Eun-sil.</font><font color="white"></font>

627
00:55:16,479 --> 00:55:17,480
<font color="white">Where is the lady?</font><font color="white"></font>

628
00:55:34,581 --> 00:55:35,874
<font color="white">The night grows cold.</font><font color="white"></font>

629
00:55:38,626 --> 00:55:40,545
<font color="white">You should return now, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

630
00:55:47,093 --> 00:55:48,386
<font color="white">Are you all right?</font><font color="white"></font>

631
00:55:53,349 --> 00:55:56,853
<font color="white">Will you accept this letter?</font><font color="white"></font>

632
00:56:02,650 --> 00:56:05,403
<font color="white">That is all I ask.</font><font color="white"></font>

633
00:56:07,655 --> 00:56:08,865
<font color="white">Within this letter…</font><font color="white"></font>

634
00:56:11,743 --> 00:56:13,286
<font color="white">lies my true heart.</font><font color="white"></font>

635
00:56:15,288 --> 00:56:17,665
<font color="white">It is proof that my feelings</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">are no falsehood.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

636
00:56:19,542 --> 00:56:22,879
<font color="white">I… I cannot leave like this.</font><font color="white"></font>

637
00:56:24,964 --> 00:56:26,883
<font color="white">I wish to clear away</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">your misunderstanding of me.</font><font color="white"></font></font>

638
00:56:27,383 --> 00:56:28,510
<font color="white">So please…</font><font color="white"></font>

639
00:56:30,303 --> 00:56:32,097
<font color="white">Oh, please,</font><font color="white"></font>

640
00:56:33,556 --> 00:56:35,433
<font color="white">will you accept this letter?</font><font color="white"></font>

641
00:56:47,195 --> 00:56:48,988
<font color="white">I believed your heart answered mine.</font><font color="white"></font>

642
00:56:51,908 --> 00:56:53,034
<font color="white">Your heart and mine</font><font color="white"></font>

643
00:56:54,953 --> 00:56:57,664
<font color="white">both desire one another, do they not?</font><font color="white"></font>

644
00:56:58,164 --> 00:56:59,040
<font color="white">And yet,</font><font color="white"></font>

645
00:56:59,791 --> 00:57:01,793
<font color="white">you will not let me do anything.</font><font color="white"></font>

646
00:57:01,876 --> 00:57:03,503
<font color="white">What am I to do?</font><font color="white"></font>

647
00:57:08,174 --> 00:57:09,092
<font color="white">Why…</font><font color="white"></font>

648
00:57:12,387 --> 00:57:14,597
<font color="white">Why did you appear before me?</font><font color="white"></font>

649
00:57:16,266 --> 00:57:19,769
<font color="white">Why appear before this wretched creature</font><font color="white">
<font color="white">who would otherwise have lived peacefully…</font><font color="white"></font></font>

650
00:57:22,856 --> 00:57:23,940
<font color="white">only to leave me…</font><font color="white"></font>

651
00:57:26,693 --> 00:57:28,278
<font color="white">longing for you so?</font><font color="white"></font>

652
00:58:00,643 --> 00:58:01,644
<font color="white">I…</font><font color="white"></font>

653
00:58:06,941 --> 00:58:09,194
<font color="white">wish to live, my lord.</font><font color="white"></font>

654
00:58:32,926 --> 00:58:33,760
<font color="white">Then I…</font><font color="white"></font>

655
00:58:37,972 --> 00:58:39,140
<font color="white">I shall…</font><font color="white"></font>

656
00:58:43,311 --> 00:58:44,479
